@startuml Codegen_Flow

title Codegen Flow

start

:User creates **Datapack**;
note right
  new Datapack("name")
end note

:User calls **createFunction()**;
note right
  returns FunctionRef
  registers FunctionNode
  auto-tags if name == "tick" / "load"
end note

:User calls **fn.build(ctx => …)**;
note right
  FunctionContext wraps FunctionNode
  ctx.say(), ctx.tellraw(), ctx.if()…
  each call pushes an ASTNode
end note

:FunctionNode holds **ASTNode[]**;

:User calls **dp.writeDatapack(path)**;

:buildDatapack() iterates **dp.functions**;

fork
  :generateFunction() per FunctionNode;
  :Dispatcher.dispatch() per node;
  :CommandHandler.generate(node, ctx);
  :ctx.emit(mcfunction string);
  :dp.files.set(name, lines.join);
fork again
  :Write **tick.json / load.json**
  from dp.tags map;
end fork

:writeDatapack() writes all files;
note right
  data/<ns>/function/*.mcfunction
  data/minecraft/tags/function/*.json
  pack.mcmeta
end note

stop

@enduml